prompts.task.restart_notice:
Subagent {task} had not delivered its result when the application last exited: its worker died with the process, and it will not continue on its own.
{last_output}
If the work is still needed, spawn a new agent under a new name. It starts with none of this one's context, so give it the task again together with whatever the text above already settles. If the result is no longer needed, nothing has to be done.

prompts.tool.bash.child.description:
